263
00:15:57.565 --> 00:15:59.959
Ah, yeah, we"re not really
looking for a pet.

264
00:16:00.133 --> 00:16:02.570
Perfect! Follow me.

265
00:16:02.744 --> 00:16:05.747
The thing about animals is
that the best time to find them

266
00:16:05.921 --> 00:16:07.705
