do really bad things to you.

1254
01:07:07.066 --> 01:07:08.633
I can"t let that happen.

1255
01:07:11.201 --> 01:07:13.986
There are no other dogs
like you.

1256
01:07:15.161 --> 01:07:17.511
And people, they just...

1257
