1328
01:11:28.936 --> 01:11:31.025
No! No, we have
to help Clifford.

1329
01:11:31.199 --> 01:11:33.811
Uncle Casey, we have to save him.
They"ll hurt him!

1330
01:11:37.858 --> 01:11:39.730
Yeah. We do.

1331
01:11:41.209 --> 01:11:42.820
