1340
01:12:09.977 --> 01:12:12.415
<i>Handle what?</i>
- You"re twelve years old. - I got this.

1341
01:12:12.589 --> 01:12:15.331
And besides,
Uncle Casey"s with me.<i>And I am so sorry,</i>

1342
01:12:15.505 --> 01:12:17.376
but, my darling, you... Emily?

1343
