1358
01:12:51.584 --> 01:12:53.630
We here at Lyfegro,
we"ve got one mission.

1359
01:12:53.804 --> 01:12:55.545
It"s to feed the world.

1360
01:12:55.719 --> 01:12:57.068
Hey, Mark, I like your tie.

1361
01:12:59.157 --> 01:13:01.072
