1391
01:14:14.101 --> 01:14:16.843
Hey, let me go. Get your hands off her!
This is unfortunate.

1392
01:14:17.017 --> 01:14:19.193
This is way too focused on me.
Look at that!

1393
01:14:19.367 --> 01:14:20.586
What is the matter with you?

1394
01:14:20.760 --> 01:14:22.160
You"re gonna set off
the fire alarm!

1395
01:14:22.327 --> 01:14:23.407
There"s another one. Just...

1396
01:14:25.591 --> 01:14:27.787
Security inside the building,
what"s going on? Go, go, go.

1397
01:14:27.811 --> 01:14:30.727
Check all the doors! Yes, sir! On it.
Doing it now.

1398
01:14:39.213 --> 01:14:41.564
