I know, I know.

1430
01:16:28.627 --> 01:16:30.629
Aw!

1431
01:16:30.803 --> 01:16:33.893
Hey, buddy. I "m happy, too.
I don"t want to break this up

1432
01:16:34.067 --> 01:16:36.330
because it is, like,
the most adorable thing

1433
