1499
01:20:00.099 --> 01:20:01.492
Whoa!

1500
01:20:01.666 --> 01:20:02.972
Hey, hey!

1501
01:20:04.321 --> 01:20:06.410
Oh, perfect.Wow.

1502
01:20:10.066 --> 01:20:13.330
Look at that dog!

1503
01:20:13.504 --> 01:20:14.635
Look at the dog.

1504
01:20:20.946 --> 01:20:21.946
Mr. Bridwell!

1505
01:20:22.034 --> 01:20:23.819
Mr. Bridwell!

1506
