Well, I went there to spend
time with an old friend.

1516
01:20:50.802 --> 01:20:52.717
A very sick old friend.

1517
01:20:52.891 --> 01:20:55.111
And he"d always
loved that bow tie,

1518
01:20:55.285 --> 01:20:56.939
so I gave it to him

1519
