1550
01:22:30.293 --> 01:22:32.382
You got this.

1551
01:22:32.556 --> 01:22:35.124
My name is Emily Elizabeth,

1552
01:22:35.298 --> 01:22:37.430
and this is my dog, Clifford.

1553
01:22:37.604 --> 01:22:39.911
I know he"s bigger
than most dogs,

1554
