in the whole wide world.

1556
01:22:46.309 --> 01:22:49.921
- It"s dangerous!
- No, he"s not dangerous! He"s just different.

1557
01:22:50.095 --> 01:22:51.314
That"s all.

1558
01:22:52.402 --> 01:22:53.751
